# Enter the flake's devShell (R + renv, pandoc, TeX Live) on cd into the repo.
# Plain direnv is enough; `use flake` ships in its stdlib. Run `direnv allow` once to trust this file.
# nix-direnv is recommended: it caches the build and holds a GC root, so `nix-collect-garbage`
# will not wipe the active devShell.
use flake
